#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:2
msgid "How to install private python packages"
msgstr "如何安装私有 Python 包"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:6
msgid "This guide is for :doc:`/commercial/index`."
msgstr "本指南适用于 :doc:`/commercial/index` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:8
msgid ""
"Read the Docs uses :ref:`pip <config-file/v2:python.install>` to install "
"your Python packages. If you have private dependencies, you can install them"
" from a :ref:`private Git repository <guides/private-python-packages:From a "
"Git repository>` or a :ref:`private repository manager <guides/private-"
"python-packages:From a repository manager other than PyPI>`."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 使用 :ref:`pip <config-file/v2:python.install>` 安装 Python "
"包。若你有私有依赖，可从 :ref:`私有 Git 仓库 <guides/private-python-packages:From a Git "
"repository>` 或 :ref:`私有仓库管理器 <guides/private-python-packages:From a "
"repository manager other than PyPI>` 安装。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:14
msgid "From a Git repository"
msgstr "从 Git 仓库"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:16
msgid ""
"Pip supports installing packages from a :ref:`Git repository <pip:vcs "
"support>` using the URI form:"
msgstr "Pip 支持用 URI 形式从 :ref:`Git 仓库 <pip:vcs support>` 安装包："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:18
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``git+https://gitprovider.com/user/project.git@{version}`` (public "
"repository)"
msgstr "``git+https://gitprovider.com/user/project.git@{version}`` （公开仓库）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:19
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``git+https://{token}@gitprovider.com/user/project.git@{version}`` (private "
"repository)"
msgstr "``git+https://{token}@gitprovider.com/user/project.git@{version}`` （私有仓库）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:21
msgid ""
"Where ``version`` can be a tag, a branch, or a commit, and ``token`` is a "
"personal access token with read only permissions from your provider."
msgstr "其中 ``version`` 可以是标签、分支或提交，``token`` 是从你的服务商获取的只读权限个人访问令牌。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:25
msgid ""
"To install a private package from a Git repositories, add the URI to your "
":ref:`requirements file <config-file/v2:Requirements file>`. Make sure to "
"use an environment variable for the token, so you don't have to hard code it"
" in the URI."
msgstr ""
"要从 Git 仓库安装私有包，将该 URI 添加到 :ref:`requirements 文件 <config-file/v2:Requirements"
" file>` 。请确保用环境变量承载令牌，避免在 URI 中硬编码。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`Pip automatically  expands <https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/reference"
"/requirements-file-format/#using-environment-variables>`__ environment "
"variables in POSIX format: using only uppercase letters and ``_``, and "
"including a dollar sign and curly brackets around the name, like "
"``${API_TOKEN}``."
msgstr ""
"`Pip automatically  expands <https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/reference"
"/requirements-file-format/#using-environment-variables>`__ 会按 POSIX "
"格式展开环境变量：仅使用大写字母和 ``_`` ，并在名称外加美元符号和花括号，如 ``${API_TOKEN}`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:29
msgid ""
"See :doc:`using environment variables in Read the Docs </environment-"
"variables>` for more information."
msgstr "更多信息请参阅 :doc:`在 Read the Docs 中使用环境变量 </environment-variables>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:32
msgid "How to get a personal access token from our supported providers"
msgstr "如何从我们支持的服务商获取个人访问令牌"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:35
msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:37
msgid ""
"You need to create a fine-grained personal access token with the "
"``Contents`` repository permission set to ``Read-only``. Follow the `GitHub "
"documentation <https://docs.github.com/en/authentication/keeping-your-"
"account-and-data-secure/managing-your-personal-access-tokens#creating-a"
"-fine-grained-personal-access-token>`__ on how to create a fine-grained "
"personal access token."
msgstr ""
"你需要创建一个细粒度个人访问令牌，并将 ``Contents`` 仓库权限设为 ``Read-only`` 。创建方法请参阅 `GitHub 文档 "
"<https://docs.github.com/en/authentication/keeping-your-account-and-data-"
"secure/managing-your-personal-access-tokens#creating-a-fine-grained-"
"personal-access-token>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:41
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:67
msgid "URI example:"
msgstr "URI 示例："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:48
msgid "GitLab"
msgstr "GitLab"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:50
msgid ""
"You need to create a deploy token with the ``read_repository`` scope for the"
" repository you want to install the package from. Follow the `GitLab "
"documentation "
"<https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/user/project/deploy_tokens/#creating-a-deploy-"
"token>`__ on how to create a deploy token."
msgstr ""
"你需要为要安装包的仓库创建一个具有 ``read_repository`` 范围的部署令牌。创建方法请参阅 `GitLab 文档 "
"<https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/user/project/deploy_tokens/#creating-a-deploy-"
"token>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:54
msgid ""
"URI example, where ``GITLAB_TOKEN_USER`` is the user from the deploy token "
"you created, not your GitLab user:"
msgstr "URI 示例，其中 ``GITLAB_TOKEN_USER`` 是你创建的部署令牌所属用户，而非你的 GitLab 用户："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:61
msgid "Bitbucket"
msgstr "Bitbucket"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:63
msgid ""
"You need to create an app password with ``Read repositories`` permissions. "
"Follow the `Bitbucket documentation "
"<https://confluence.atlassian.com/bitbucket/app-passwords-828781300.html>`__"
" on how to create an app password."
msgstr ""
"你需要创建一个具有 ``Read repositories`` 权限的应用密码。创建方法请参阅 `Bitbucket 文档 "
"<https://confluence.atlassian.com/bitbucket/app-passwords-828781300.html>`__"
" 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:73
msgid "Here ``BITBUCKET_USER`` is your Bitbucket user."
msgstr "其中 ``BITBUCKET_USER`` 是你的 Bitbucket 用户。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:77
msgid ""
"Bitbucket doesn't support app passwords per repository. An app password will"
" grant read access to all repositories the user has access to. You can "
"create a `machine user <https://confluence.atlassian.com/bitbucketserver"
"/ssh-access-keys-for-system-use-776639781.html>`__ to give read access only "
"to the repositories you need."
msgstr ""
"Bitbucket 不支持按仓库设置应用密码。应用密码会授予该用户可访问的所有仓库的读取权限。你可以创建一个 `machine user "
"<https://confluence.atlassian.com/bitbucketserver/ssh-access-keys-for-"
"system-use-776639781.html>`__ ，仅授予所需仓库的读取权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:82
msgid "From a repository manager other than PyPI"
msgstr "从 PyPI 以外的仓库管理器"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:84
msgid ""
"By default Pip installs your packages from `PyPI <https://pypi.org/>`__. If "
"you are using a different repository manager like *pypiserver*, or *Nexus "
"Repository*, you need to get the index URL from your repository manager and "
"set the :option:`pip:--index-url` option in one of the following ways:"
msgstr ""
"默认 Pip 从 `PyPI <https://pypi.org/>`__ 安装你的包。若你使用其他仓库管理器（如 *pypiserver* 或 "
"*Nexus Repository* ），需从仓库管理器获取索引 URL，并通过以下方式之一设置 :option:`pip:--index-url` "
"选项："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:88
msgid ""
"Set the ``PIP_INDEX_URL`` :doc:`environment variable in Read the Docs "
"</environment-variables>` with the index URL. See the Requirements File "
"`environment variables <https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/reference"
"/requirements-file-format#using-environment-variables>`__ reference."
msgstr ""
"将索引 URL 设置到 Read the Docs 的 ``PIP_INDEX_URL`` :doc:`环境变量 </environment-"
"variables>` 中。参见 Requirements File 的 `environment variables "
"<https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/reference/requirements-file-format#using-"
"environment-variables>`__ 参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-python-packages.rst:90
msgid ""
"Put ``--index-url=https://my-index-url.com/`` at the top of your "
"requirements file. See :ref:`pip:requirements-file-format`."
msgstr ""
"在 requirements 文件顶部放置 ``--index-url=https://my-index-url.com/`` 。参见 "
":ref:`pip:requirements-file-format` 。"

